  "about_item": [
    "DESHEDDING DOG BRUSH – Keep your home hair free by reducing daily shedding. Jelly Pet Deshedding Massage Brush is used on a wet or dry coat - cat or dog. Run through a dry coat and the long flexible rubber tips gently loosen the undercoat, removing hair and dead skin. The loose hair collects on the brush and can be easily removed by hand.",
    "DEEPS CLEANS AND LATHERS – Use in the tub and get more bang for your buck. Achieve better performance from your shampoo and less hair left in the bath. Jelly Pet Dog Bath Brush will lather the shampoo evenly through the coat, massaging down to the hair follicles to deep clean the coat. It easily removes dirt, dander and collects the loose hair as you wash.",
    "MASSAGES AND RELAXES – The flexible rubber brush head relaxes your pet during bath time, providing one long comfortable scratch. The soft silicone nubs flex to massage the skin gently and stimulates the production of natural oils of the coat for healthy growth and shine. Perfect for even sensitive dogs, and perfect for you. Bath time becomes a pleasant, enjoyable experience.",
    "EASY GRIP HANDLE – Designed with a comfortable easy grip handle for lathering with ease without the brush slipping or the hand cramping. The handy hole allows you to hang the brush wherever you bath your dog or cat. The brush nubs are flexible, the head and handle are sturdy.",
    "ABOUT JELLY PET - A Jolly Pooch is a Jelly Pet. Designed in California; we pride ourselves in making pet grooming products that are great for pets and their owners. All our products are designed by professional groomers and used by serious pet parents."
  ],
